@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Forum Diskusi
autonumber

actor "Guru" as Guru
boundary "UI_Forum" as UI
control "Control_Forum" as Control
entity "T_ForumTopik" as E_Topik
entity "T_ForumBalasan" as E_Balasan

== Skenario: Menampilkan Daftar Topik ==
Guru -> UI : 1. Mengakses Dashboard LMS (Tab Forum Diskusi)
activate UI
UI -> Control : 2. RequestDaftarTopik(Kelas)
activate Control
Control -> E_Topik : 3. AmbilDataTopik()
activate E_Topik
E_Topik --> Control : 4. DataDitemukan(Data)
deactivate E_Topik
Control --> UI : 5. TampilkanDaftarTopik(Data)
deactivate Control
UI --> Guru : 6. Daftar Topik Terbuka
deactivate UI

== Skenario A: Buat Topik Baru ==
Guru -> UI : 7. Membuat Topik Baru (Isi, Lampiran, Pin)
activate UI
UI -> Control : 8. SubmitTopikBaru(Data)
activate Control
Control -> E_Topik : 9. InsertDataTopik()
activate E_Topik
deactivate E_Topik
note right of E_Topik: Konvensi Assumed Success diterapkan

Control -> Control : 10. Kirim Notifikasi ke Seluruh Siswa
Control --> UI : 11. NotifikasiSukses()
deactivate Control
UI --> Guru : 12. Topik Berhasil Dibuat
deactivate UI

== Skenario B: Kelola Topik (Edit/Hapus/Tutup) ==
Guru -> UI : 13. Memilih Aksi (Edit / Hapus / Tutup Topik)
activate UI
UI -> Control : 14. EksekusiAksiTopik(ID_Topik, Aksi)
activate Control
Control -> E_Topik : 15. Update / Delete DataTopik()
activate E_Topik
deactivate E_Topik
Control --> UI : 16. NotifikasiSukses()
deactivate Control
UI --> Guru : 17. Status Topik Berhasil Diperbarui
deactivate UI

== Skenario C: Berpartisipasi (Membalas Komentar) ==
Guru -> UI : 18. Membaca Komentar Siswa & Menulis Balasan
activate UI
UI -> Control : 19. SubmitBalasan(ID_Topik, TeksBalasan)
activate Control
Control -> E_Balasan : 20. InsertBalasan()
activate E_Balasan
deactivate E_Balasan
Control --> UI : 21. NotifikasiSukses()
deactivate Control
UI --> Guru : 22. Balasan Berhasil Dikirim
deactivate UI

@enduml
